42233::$$$message_0331_0000_0000$$$::"Sella, it's so pretty. The forest is glowing."::
42234::$$$message_0331_0000_0001$$$::"What you see are fireflies. They're a summer insect.[lr]::
42235::$$$message_0331_0000_0002$$$::Not something you would see in our homeland."::
42236::$$$message_0331_0000_0003$$$::"Yeah. The buildings were made from wood, too. Curious."::
42237::$$$message_0331_0000_0004$$$::"...Yes. I can't claim to like humans as a whole, but there are things to admire about this land's culture."::
42238::$$$message_0331_0000_0005$$$::"Yes, once we return here, let us enjoy the hot springs again."::
42239::$$$message_0331_0000_0006$$$::"I'll do it too.[lr]::
42240::$$$message_0331_0000_0007$$$::Let's bathe together next time, Sella."::
42241::$$$message_0331_0000_0008$$$::"N-[wait canskip=0 time=200][wvs][say storage=HMEDE_SER_0060 _name=セラ]no, [wait canskip=0 time=200][wvs][say storage=HMEDE_SER_0070 _name=セラ]that would be... [wait canskip=0 time=300][l][say storage=HMEDE_SER_0080 _name=セラ]E-enjoy it on your own, Leysritt. You should take advantage of the reservation to enjoy the bath to its fullest."::
42242::$$$message_0331_0000_0009$$$::"...Mrgh.[lr]::
42243::$$$message_0331_0000_0010$$$::Are you covering your chest, Sella?"::
42244::$$$message_0331_0000_0011$$$::"I am n-n-not!"::
42245::$$$message_0331_0000_0012$$$::"...Good grief.[lr]::
42246::$$$message_0331_0000_0013$$$::Why is there such a difference in build when we're supposed to be homunculi of the same template...?":&�